BELOW ARE REQUESTED STATISTICS FOR SECOND QUARTER 1973,
EXCLUSIVE OF B.L.E.U., ARRANGED BY SITC SECTION OR
DIVISION ACCORDING TO FOLLOWING CODE,
A.  TOTAL WEIGHT OF EXPORTS TO WORLD IN TONS,
B.  WEIGHT US PORTION IN TONS,
C.  TOTAL VALUE OF EXPORTS TO WORLD IN THOUSAND DUTCH GUILDERS,
D.  TOTAL VALUE US PORTION IN THOUSAND GUILDERS.
SECTION 5, A. 5801163,  B. 331754,   C.  4160789,  D. 150525;
