IN ORDER TO REPAIR THE ENGINE ON OUR SECURITY 1971 PLYMOUTH
V-8 440 FURY (C.D. 1478) SEDAN, WE REQUIRE THE FOLLOWING PARTS:
ONE EA. GASKET SET FOR ENGINE OVERHAUL; ONE EA. BEARING
PACKAGE, CRANK SHAFT; ONE EA. BEARING PACKAGE, CAM SHAFT;
ONE EA. SPROCKET, CRANK SHAFT; ONE EA. TIMING CHAIN; ONE EA.
SPROCKET, CAM SHAFT; ONE CONNECTING ROD BEARING PACKAGE;
EIGHT EA. PISTONS WITH PIN; EIGHT EA. PISTON RING SETS;
EIGHT EA. PUSH ROD VALVES; 16 EA. LEFT AND RIGHT ROCKER
VALVES; 8 EA. TAPPETS; ONE EA. WATER PUMP.
CHAPLIN
